{"seq":2,"slug":"slowmove-attribution-selection-price","title":"滞销归因：选品/定价/预测/季节","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/capital-attribution/slowmove-attribution-selection-price","wordCount":1900,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"滞销归因-选品-定价-预测-季节\">滞销归因：选品/定价/预测/季节</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>确诊「这批货卖不动」之后，下一个问题必然是「为什么」。滞销归因的价值在于<strong>把不可执行的现象转成可执行的原因</strong>：如果结论是「市场不好」，没人能改；如果结论是「这个 SKU 的售价高于同类 18% 导致转化率低 40%」，定价团队明天就能动。</p>\n<p>归因框架把滞销的原因收敛到四条互斥且穷尽的线上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>选品（assortment）</strong>：商品本身或其在目标市场的适配性有问题——尺码带错、颜色偏好不符、功能冗余于当地使用习惯。</li>\n<li><strong>定价（pricing）</strong>：转化受阻于价格带，包括售价高于市场、促销节奏错位、跨境税费转嫁导致终端价失真。</li>\n<li><strong>预测（forecast）</strong>：需求判断偏差导致超量采购，需求本身存在但不是这个量。</li>\n<li><strong>季节（seasonality）</strong>：需求是周期性的，当前处于淡季，静置一段时间即可恢复。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>四条线的处置动作完全不同：选品问题要<strong>退市或改款</strong>，定价问题要<strong>调价或改促销</strong>，预测问题要<strong>修正模型与采购纪律</strong>，季节问题要<strong>等待或跨区调拨</strong>。归因错误的代价是把季节性商品按死库存清掉——这是跨境卖家最昂贵的一类错误。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[滞销 SKU] --&gt; B{同品类大盘是否也跌}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[市场/季节因素]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{该 SKU 转化率 vs 同价位均值}&#10;  D --&gt;|显著低| E{售价分位}&#10;  E --&gt;|高于同类 15%+| F[定价问题]&#10;  E --&gt;|正常| G[选品问题&lt;br/&gt;商品本身不适配]&#10;  D --&gt;|正常| H{采购量 vs 预测需求量}&#10;  H --&gt;|远超| I[预测问题&lt;br/&gt;超量采购]&#10;  H --&gt;|相当| J[需求侧突变&lt;br/&gt;外部事件]&#10;  C --&gt; K{历史同期是否有峰值}&#10;  K --&gt;|有| L[季节问题&lt;br/&gt;等待或跨区]&#10;  K --&gt;|无| M[结构性市场下滑]\">graph TD\n  A[滞销 SKU] --&gt; B{同品类大盘是否也跌}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[市场/季节因素]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{该 SKU 转化率 vs 同价位均值}\n  D --&gt;|显著低| E{售价分位}\n  E --&gt;|高于同类 15%+| F[定价问题]\n  E --&gt;|正常| G[选品问题&lt;br/&gt;商品本身不适配]\n  D --&gt;|正常| H{采购量 vs 预测需求量}\n  H --&gt;|远超| I[预测问题&lt;br/&gt;超量采购]\n  H --&gt;|相当| J[需求侧突变&lt;br/&gt;外部事件]\n  C --&gt; K{历史同期是否有峰值}\n  K --&gt;|有| L[季节问题&lt;br/&gt;等待或跨区]\n  K --&gt;|无| M[结构性市场下滑]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归因线</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>验证方法</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选品</td>\n<td>转化率显著低于同价位均值且价格正常</td>\n<td>同价位对标组转化率对比</td>\n<td>退市/改款/换市场</td>\n<td>1–2 季度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>售价分位 &gt; 85% 且转化率随价格弹性下降</td>\n<td>价格弹性回归、A/B</td>\n<td>调价/改促销结构</td>\n<td>天–周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测</td>\n<td>采购量 / 实际需求 &gt; 1.5 且预测偏差为正</td>\n<td>预测误差分解（bias 符号）</td>\n<td>修模型、调采购纪律</td>\n<td>月–季</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节</td>\n<td>历史同期有明确峰值且当期为谷</td>\n<td>季节性分解、同比</td>\n<td>等待/跨区调拨</td>\n<td>周–月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四条线的量化判据\">四条线的量化判据</h2><h3 id=\"选品-转化率对标而非销量对标\">选品：转化率对标而非销量对标</h3><p>销量低不等于选品差——可能是曝光不足。选品的判据应是<strong>转化率在给定流量下显著低于同价位对标组</strong>。构建对标组时要控制三个变量：价格带、品类、市场站点。跨境还要控制<strong>本地化适配度</strong>，例如服装的尺码带必须按目标市场的实际体型分布评估，而不是按国内尺码带简单换算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定价-用价格弹性而非卖价绝对值\">定价：用价格弹性而非卖价绝对值</h3><p>判据不是「售价高」而是「价格弹性显著为负且弹性绝对值大」。按 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Price_optimization\">Price optimization</a> 的描述，零售定价是「determine how customers will respond to different prices for its products and services through different channels」的过程，其目标是「maximizing operating profit」，而降价清仓属于其中一类「capacity is constrained and perishable and customer willingness-to-pay decreases over time」的情形。该来源强调这类模型把「predict how demand varies at different price points」的预测与「cost and inventory levels」结合来选价格点——这意味着归因结论必须落到<strong>弹性估计值</strong>，而不是「感觉贵」。</p>\n<p>跨境定价归因有一个特有陷阱：<strong>终端价失真</strong>。平台售价包含了关税、VAT、平台佣金、物流费，若把终端价与国内售价直接比，会得出「定价过高」的错误结论，实际是税费结构不同。归因必须还原到「出厂价 + 落地成本 + 平台费 + 目标毛利」的拆解，见 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest\">调拨/促销/清仓建议</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预测-用偏差符号而非误差绝对值\">预测：用偏差符号而非误差绝对值</h3><p>预测问题要区分<strong>偏差（bias）<strong>与</strong>精度（accuracy）</strong>。按 <a href=\"https://otexts.com/fpp3/accuracy.html\">Forecasting: Principles and Practice</a> 的定义，预测误差是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{T+h} = y_{T+h} - \\hat{y}_{T+h|T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」，正误差意味着预测偏低。该来源同时指出 MAE、RMSE、MAPE、MASE 「measure error magnitude but cancel the signs needed to identify consistent bias」，也就是说<strong>看 MAPE 只能知道预测准不准，看不出系统性高估还是低估</strong>——而要定位超量采购，需要的恰恰是符号。</p>\n<p>工程结论：归因报表必须同时输出 MAPE（精度）与平均误差 ME（偏差），并用 ME 的符号判定方向。连续三个周期 ME &gt; 0 说明系统性低估（导致缺货），ME &lt; 0 说明系统性高估（导致超储）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"季节-先做分解再作判断\">季节：先做分解再作判断</h3><p>季节性判据必须在<strong>去除趋势与随机项</strong>之后做。直接用同比会因为趋势掩盖季节信号。标准做法是 STL 分解或移动平均去趋势后看季节因子；如果该月的季节因子显著低于 1，则是季节原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因的工程实现\">归因的工程实现</h2><h3 id=\"归因表结构\">归因表结构</h3><p>归因不是一次性分析，而是持续运行的诊断作业。它的输出应是一张可下钻的归因表：每个滞销 SKU 一行，带四条线的得分、主因、置信度、证据链接。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE fact_slowmove_attribution (&#10;  snapshot_date      DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id             VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  market_code        CHAR(2)      NOT NULL,&#10;  excess_qty         DECIMAL(14,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  excess_cost_landed DECIMAL(14,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  category_gmv_delta DECIMAL(8,4),      -- 大盘同比，判定市场/季节&#10;  conv_rate          DECIMAL(8,5),      -- 该 SKU 转化率&#10;  conv_rate_peer     DECIMAL(8,5),      -- 同价位对标组转化率&#10;  price_percentile   DECIMAL(5,2),      -- 售价在同品类分位&#10;  elasticity_est     DECIMAL(8,3),      -- 估计价格弹性&#10;  forecast_me        DECIMAL(8,3),      -- 滚动 3 期平均误差（偏差）&#10;  forecast_mape      DECIMAL(8,4),&#10;  seasonal_factor    DECIMAL(6,3),      -- 当期季节因子&#10;  primary_cause      VARCHAR(16),       -- ASSORTMENT / PRICING / FORECAST / SEASON&#10;  confidence         DECIMAL(4,3),&#10;  evidence_ref       VARCHAR(256),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (snapshot_date, sku_id, market_code)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fact_slowmove_attribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_date      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market_code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  excess_qty         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  excess_cost_landed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_gmv_delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 大盘同比，判定市场/季节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  conv_rate          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该 SKU 转化率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  conv_rate_peer     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同价位对标组转化率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  price_percentile   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 售价在同品类分位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  elasticity_est     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 估计价格弹性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  forecast_me        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 滚动 3 期平均误差（偏差）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  forecast_mape      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seasonal_factor    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 当期季节因子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  primary_cause      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ASSORTMENT / PRICING / FORECAST / SEASON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ref       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (snapshot_date, sku_id, market_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>confidence</code> 是必需的，不是可选装饰。任何单一判据都可能误判——季节因子低的 SKU 也可能同时定价偏高。置信度低于阈值的应进人工复核队列，而不是直接触发清仓。这与 <a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert\">呆滞识别规则</a> 的「统计判据 + 人工复核」是同一套设计哲学。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定的优先级\">判定的优先级</h3><p>四条线不能平权判定，必须有优先级，因为一条 SKU 常常同时命中多条。推荐的优先级是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>市场/季节先判</strong>（大盘同比 + 季节因子）。如果大盘同跌且季节因子低，先归季节，避免误杀。</li>\n<li><strong>再判预测</strong>（ME 符号 + 采购/需求比）。超量采购是最可由内部修正的原因。</li>\n<li><strong>再判定价</strong>（弹性 + 价格分位）。定价可在周级验证，试错成本低。</li>\n<li><strong>最后判选品</strong>。选品是终局结论，需要排除以上三条后才下。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个顺序的理由是<strong>处置成本递增</strong>：季节只需等，预测改纪律，定价调价，选品要退市。先排除低成本可逆的原因，再下高成本不可逆的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与健康度-拨备的衔接\">与健康度、拨备的衔接</h2><p>归因结果是 <a href=\"../inventory-health-metric/health-score-redyellow-green\">库存健康度评分</a> 里呆滞维度的<strong>加权依据</strong>：同为超储，预测原因造成的比季节原因造成的更该扣分，因为前者反映流程失效、后者反映正常经营。评分若不区分原因，会惩罚正常经营行为。</p>\n<p>归因也直接影响 <a href=\"inventory-provision-finance-link\">存货跌价拨备</a> 的计提比例：季节性滞销的可变现净值应按正常售价估算，只需承担时间价值损失；选品或结构性市场下滑导致的滞销则应按清仓价甚至报废价估算。两者的计提比例可能相差数倍，而归因是唯一能区分它们的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>滞销归因收敛到四条线：选品、定价、预测、季节，四者处置动作与时序完全不同。</li>\n<li>选品用「同价位对标组转化率」判据，定价用弹性估计值而非售价绝对值，预测用偏差符号而非 MAPE，季节先做分解。</li>\n<li>跨境定价必须还原税费与平台费结构，直接比终端价会误判。</li>\n<li>归因表必须带 <code>confidence</code>，低置信度进人工复核，不做自动清仓触发。</li>\n<li>判定按「处置成本递增」排序：季节 → 预测 → 定价 → 选品。</li>\n<li>归因结论是健康度评分呆滞维度的加权依据，也是 <a href=\"inventory-provision-finance-link\">拨备</a> 计提比例的区分证据。</li>\n<li>定价与清仓的具体动作归执行层，见 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest\">调拨/促销/清仓建议</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滞销归因：选品/定价/预测/季节","id":"滞销归因-选品-定价-预测-季节"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四条线的量化判据","id":"四条线的量化判据"},{"level":3,"text":"选品：转化率对标而非销量对标","id":"选品-转化率对标而非销量对标"},{"level":3,"text":"定价：用价格弹性而非卖价绝对值","id":"定价-用价格弹性而非卖价绝对值"},{"level":3,"text":"预测：用偏差符号而非误差绝对值","id":"预测-用偏差符号而非误差绝对值"},{"level":3,"text":"季节：先做分解再作判断","id":"季节-先做分解再作判断"},{"level":2,"text":"归因的工程实现","id":"归因的工程实现"},{"level":3,"text":"归因表结构","id":"归因表结构"},{"level":3,"text":"判定的优先级","id":"判定的优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"与健康度、拨备的衔接","id":"与健康度-拨备的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库存资金占用与持有成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/capital-attribution/inventory-carrying-cost-capital"},"next":{"title":"存货跌价拨备与财务衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/capital-attribution/inventory-provision-finance-link"}}